// "if there is a …": `Condition.Exists` over a bare description. A phrasing
// macro under the constructor's own name with a narrower signature, so no
// alias is minted (ADR 12.1). Lean spells it `exists_`, `exists` being a Lean
// keyword (ADR 11).
(
    name: "exists",
    kinds: [Condition],
    params: {"p": Predicate},
    body: Exists(Described(Bare, Param(p))),
)
